# Implementation Plan: Futuristic 3D Robot Navigation Portfolio

Create a highly interactive, futuristic portfolio website centered around a 3D humanoid AI robot acting as the navigation system. 

The application will upgrade the existing codebase (`index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js`) using a premium vanilla tech stack: **HTML5, Custom CSS, JavaScript (ES6), Three.js (3D engine via CDN), and GSAP (animation engine via CDN)**. This guarantees high performance, quick loading, and zero compile-time dependencies, while delivering cutting-edge WebGL graphics.

---

