## File Modifications

### `[MODIFY]` [index.html](file:///c:/Users/LOQ/antigravity/index.html)
- Clean up the traditional portfolio HTML structure.
- Embed canvas elements for the 3D robot, particle background, and custom cursor.
- Build the overlay system for holographic panels, tooltips, sound toggle controls, and AI Voice Assistant trigger.
- Add Three.js, OrbitControls, and GSAP CDN script tags.

### `[MODIFY]` [style.css](file:///c:/Users/LOQ/antigravity/style.css)
- Restyle the page with a dark cyber-grid background, neon color palettes (cyan `#00f0ff`, magenta `#ff007f`, purple `#9d00ff`).
- Create glassmorphic holographic panels (`backdrop-filter: blur(12px)`) with glowing borders, scanlines, and tech corners.
- Define styles for tooltips, neural network nodes, timelines, and certificate vaults.

### `[MODIFY]` [script.js](file:///c:/Users/LOQ/antigravity/script.js)
- Implement Three.js setup (renderer, scene, camera, ambient/directional/point lights, post-processing for bloom if required, or high-emissive glow materials).
- Implement the robot geometry definition, brain particle network, core reactor animation, and background particle galaxy.
- Program Raycaster detection for hover and click, custom camera zoom animations using GSAP.
- Build the Web Audio synth, custom cursor trail, speech synthesis AI Assistant, and panel open/close triggers.
- Re-bind the contact form functionality with EmailJS.

