## Verification Plan

### Automated / Browser Testing
- Run locally and use browser tools to:
  1. Inspect WebGL rendering performance and FPS.
  2. Verify correct click detection and camera transition coordinates for all 8 interactive body parts.
  3. Verify mobile responsiveness and fallback layout (if mobile screen size, adapt camera zoom and panel sizes).
  4. Test EmailJS message dispatching.

### Manual Verification
- Test cursor tracking, sound effects toggling, voice synthesis initialization, and certificate modal popups in the browser.
